Frontmatter without a closing `---` isn't frontmatter, so no header prints and the headings after it are listed from L3.
== args
input/bad-frontmatter.md
== file input/bad-frontmatter.md
---
title: Broken
# Visible heading
## Also visible
== stdout
input/bad-frontmatter.md (4 lines)
[L3-L4] # Visible heading
[L4-L4] ## Also visible
== stderr
== exit 0
